{
    "id": "OSPS-AC-01",
    "meta": {
        "name": "Use MFA for Sensitive Actions",
        "description": "The project's version control system MUST require multi-factor authentication for collaborators modifying the project repository settings or accessing sensitive data.\n\nChecked through the repository's SLSA source provenance with the `slsa-source/ghorg` policy, which establishes that the repository is hosted in a GitHub organization.",
